# A wild Pokémon of Johto (HeartGold's battle theme for the wild ones): a falling run into a bright, jumping square
# lead in D minor over a galloping bass. Original composition for this game (plan 20 · J4).
title Battle! Wild Pokémon (Johto)
tempo 172
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.08
reverb 0.16

track lead square lowhp=sawlead vol=0.86 pan=0.05 rev=0.18
  o6 d16 c16 o5 a16 f16 d16 c16 o4 a16 f16 d8 r8 r4 | o4 a8 r8 a8 r8 o5 c8 d8 e8 f8 | L o5 d4 f8 a8 o6 d4 o5 a4 | o5 b-4 o6 d8 o5 b-8 f4 d4 |
  o5 c4 e8 g8 o6 c4 o5 g4 | o5 a4 c+8 e8 a4 e4 | o5 d4 f8 a8 o6 d4 o5 f4 | o5 g4 b-8 o6 d8 o5 g4 b-4 |
  o5 a4 g8 f8 e4 g4 | o5 a2 d2 |

track pad strings unless=lowhp vol=0.28 pan=-0.25 rev=0.22
  r1 | r1 | L o4 (d f a)1 | (d f b-)1 |
  (c e g)1 | (c+ e a)1 | (d f a)1 | (d g b-)1 |
  (c+ e a)1 | (d f a)1 |

